	(footprint "Heatsinks:TO-264-3_Vertical_HS657-10ABPE"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "c28fc877-869f-4063-8fc9-28472e2792ef")
		(at 80.7 106.65 -90)
		(descr "TO-264-3 vertical transistor (RM 5.45mm, MJL21193/MJL21194) bolted to a Wakefield 657-10ABPE vertical board-mount heat sink (extrusion 6533 - identical base/pad/pin pattern for all 657-10/15/20/25ABPE; the -10 = 1in/25.4mm tall variant is used to fit the 100x160 Eurocard). Combined footprint: pads 1/2/3 = device B/C/E (drill 1.5mm); two unnamed plated pads = heat-sink wave-solder pins (6533 extrusion, 0.093in/2.4mm pins on 1.000in/25.4mm centres, centred on device tab axis). Heat-sink base 41.9 x 25.4mm; device mounting hole 0.144in/3.7mm at 21.6mm up the vertical face (NOT a board hole). Pad pitch and pin span are exact; the pin-row depth (Y) is set 8.0mm behind the lead plane (~4mm into the base per the 6533 drawing) and should be verified against the physical part before fabrication. Thermal 6.8 C/W natural, 3.7 C/W @ 200 LFM. Isolate device tab from sink with an insulating thermal pad (Same Sky/Wakefield WTI7R1F0-1.00X0.75) plus a #4 shoulder washer (Boyd 7721-7PPSG) on the mounting bolt. Per-device dissipation ~4.5W avg (fan-cooled Tj ~69C) per v3 power analysis.")
		(tags "TO-264 TO-247 heatsink 657-10ABPE Wakefield vertical MJL21193 MJL21194 power pass transistor")
